.KEY DONE/A,TAG/A
.BRA {
.KET }
; InstallClicks -- the clicks for T=Install, in a process of its own,
; so that the Installer runs in the FOREGROUND and its return code can be
; read: files on disk cannot tell a finished installation from one that
; stopped on its last page (Herald's lesson).
;
; MEASURED on the rtg32 autotest screen with Herald's installer, the same
; Installer on the same screen. Its window swaps two page shapes:
;
;   a page with a button GRID  Proceed x 80..317, y 320..339 on row 1,
;                              About and Help on row 2 (y 339..358, About
;                              x 80..317, Help 322..564)
;   a page with ONE button     x 201..438, y 339..358: the closing page
;                              and every error page
;
;   (198, 330)  Proceed on a grid page; in the text of a one-button page
;   (320, 348)  the one button; on a grid page the GAP between About and
;               Help, which does nothing
;
; So every round clicks both and the page decides which one lands. A
; (message) page has a third shape (Proceed where About is) that neither
; point reaches -- which is why install/Install puts every notice a novice
; must see on its closing page and shows no (message) to a novice.
;
; (Measured with the Prisma Megamix package's Installer, where this script
; comes from: the same Installer, the same rtg32 screen.)
;
; Rounds stop once the DONE file exists (the test writes it when the
; Installer has returned): later clicks would land on whatever Workbench
; shows. ONE DONE FILE PER RUN: with one for both, the first run's clicker
; was still finishing its rounds when the second Installer came up, and
; clicked on its pages. Every round grabs the screen before each of its
; two clicks (install-<TAG>-<round>.ppm and -<round>b.ppm): the account of
; every page, and of the one a run stuck on.
;
;   Run Execute DEV:Test/InstallClicks RAM:InstallDone1 a
Wait 6
If NOT EXISTS {DONE}
  DEV:Test/Grab 0 0 640 480 DEV:Test/install-{TAG}-01.ppm
  DEV:Test/InputPoke X=198 Y=330 CLICKS=1
  Wait 3
  DEV:Test/Grab 0 0 640 480 DEV:Test/install-{TAG}-01b.ppm
  DEV:Test/InputPoke X=320 Y=348 CLICKS=1
  Wait 3
EndIf
